[h1]Deep Space AI: Probably DeepSeek — Pawnshop Maid Assistant "Xiaojing"[/h1]
Looking for a helpful hand around your pawnshop? This mod introduces "Xiaojing", an interactive AI maid assistant (inspired by the DeepSeek mascot).
Chat with her naturally, and let her help you organize your pawnshop, sort your inventory, and check customer budgets and preferences!

[h2]💡 A Note on Early Development[/h2]
This mod is currently in [b]early active development, with a limited and basic set of features[/b].
Xiaojing is still learning and growing, and more features and interactions will be added over time.
[b]If you have any suggestions, feature requests, or run into any bugs, please feel free to leave a comment below![/b]
Every comment is warmly welcomed and directly helps guide future updates!

[h2]✨ Current Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]💬 [b]Interactive Portrait & Natural Language Chat[/b]
Xiaojing stays on the left side of your pawnshop. Simply click on her portrait to open the chat window and talk freely (press [b]F6[/b] anytime to show or hide the portrait).
[*]📦 [b]Hands to Organize Your Shop[/b]
Tired of rummaging through bags and containers? Just tell her naturally:
· “Put all the food from my inventory onto the counter.”
· “Move the scrap metal into the furnace input.”
· “Fetch a specific note from the mentor's notes in the archive.”
Supports inventory, bags, nested folders, storage tabs, and machine compartments while respecting native game rules.
[*]👥 [b]Customer & Budget Inquiries[/b]
Unsure about a customer's intentions? Ask Xiaojing directly:
· “Who is this customer, and are they here to buy or sell?”
· “How much budget does this customer have left, and what are their preferences?”
· “Check if I have items they want in my inventory, but let me know first before moving anything.”
She will query live customer preferences, refusal rules, and barter/order requirements.
[*]⚙️ [b]Flexible API & Customizable Persona (F7)[/b]
Press [b]F7[/b] to open the settings window. Supports any OpenAI-compatible API endpoint (such as DeepSeek, OpenAI, or local models via Ollama/vLLM).
Comes with a lively maid persona by default, and you can freely customize the system prompt in the settings to shape her personality to your liking!
[*]🌐 [b]Automatic Bilingual Support[/b]
UI, system prompts, and tool descriptions automatically adapt to the game's language (Chinese / English).
[/list]

[h2]🛠️ Quick Start & Notes[/h2]
[list]
[*]1. When enabling the mod in the game's Mods menu, confirm the network permission prompt, then restart the game.
[*]2. In the pawnshop, press [b]F7[/b] to configure your API endpoint and API Key (DeepSeek's official API is recommended for quality and affordability). Use the test button to verify your connection.
[*]3. [b]Bring Your Own API Key[/b]: The mod connects directly from your local client to your chosen provider; no built-in API quota is included. Your API key is stored locally on your PC.
[*]4. [b]Native Game Rules[/b]: Xiaojing only moves items according to normal game rules. She will not spawn items, auto-complete deals, or alter game balance.
[/list]

[h2]💬 Feedback & Suggestions[/h2]
What tasks or features would you like Xiaojing to help with in future updates?
Feel free to leave your thoughts, ideas, and feature requests in the comments. Thank you for your support and feedback!
